{
 "about": [
  "Hand-verified reading of card text (plan Task 4). Each entry was written by reading `text` (the synced, cleaned card text at fixture capture), not from parser output.",
  "A card matches when the parser clauses that carry at least one effect, in sentence order, equal `clauses`: same trigger and the same multiset of [kind, target] effects.",
  "Selection: the ten cards the research prototype mis-targeted (mechanics §2.1), the tech cards of theory §3, five or more per major axis, and ten drawn with mulberry32(2026) from released cards with text that are not already listed and not in the overrides list of mechanics §5.",
  "Target conventions: self = this card; own_here / enemy_here / all_here = cards in play at this card's location (all = both sides); own_anywhere / enemy_anywhere / all_anywhere = in play at any location (a named location such as \"the middle location\" is anywhere); own_other_locations = your cards (or your side's power) at the other locations; own_hand / own_deck / enemy_hand / enemy_deck = cards in that zone; both = both players, both hands or both decks; own / enemy = a side without a zone (created, summoned or board-added cards, side-wide cost rules); own_player / enemy_player = the player (energy, draws, play limits); own_next_played, own_played_card, enemy_played_card, own_moved_card, enemy_moved_card = the card named by the trigger; location = the location itself.",
  "Kind conventions: positive Power = buff, negative Power = afflict (also on own cards); copy_card targets where the copy lands; resurrect targets whose card returns; merge targets the other card of the merge; loc_power targets the side that gets the Power; a bare \"+N Power\" with no recipient is self."
 ],
